"use": "風俗ビル (a grey-zone adult-entertainment building in the 歓楽街; non-explicit): a five-storey 4 x 9 間 雑居ビル -- F1 reception (counter, lit menu board) and the waiting room; F2 a host club lounge (box seats, the bar, the bottle wall); F3-F4 four private rooms a floor off a corridor; F5 the back office (takings safes, camera monitors, the manager). Lift, one stair, a bouncer spawn, pink and red 袖看板. probe_xz is on the ground floor. kits/interiors/AdultServices.blend (the artist's; a PLACEHOLDER shell and fit-out, ARTIST_NOTES.md lists what to replace)",
"wall_top_m": 17.2
